      "Shape it in the panels below: Transform Controls for Translate X, Translate Y, Rotate (deg), Scale and Opacity, Trigger Selector for Auto Play, On Hover or On Click, the Keyframe Editor for per-percentage opacity and transform values with a live 'Generated CSS' preview, and the Color 1 and Color 2 pickers with the Use Gradient switch.",
      "Type a word such as fade, zoom or rotate into the AI Animation Generator and press Generate Animation to swap in matching keyframes, then in the Export Animation panel set Export video Size (px) and press Export Video to record about two seconds of the preview to animation.webm, or Export Lottie to save animation.json."
